/F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 742 Tm (Vendor Payment Approval Limits) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 714 Tm (Owner: Finance, Accounts Payable) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (Version 5, effective 1 April 2026) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 686 Tm (Audience: Finance) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 658 Tm (1. Purpose) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 640 Tm (This document sets out who may approve a payment to a vendor, depending on the amount.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 626 Tm (It applies to all invoices and all payment methods.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 598 Tm (2. Approval limits) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 580 Tm (The limit applies to the total value of the invoice, including tax.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 560 Tm (- Up to 5,000 EUR: Finance Analyst.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 546 Tm (- Above 5,000 EUR and up to 25,000 EUR: Finance Manager.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 532 Tm (- Above 25,000 EUR and up to 100,000 EUR: Finance Director.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 518 Tm (- Above 100,000 EUR: Chief Financial Officer.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 84 504 Tm (- Above 500,000 EUR: Chief Financial Officer and Chief Operating Officer together.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 484 Tm (An invoice must not be split into smaller invoices to stay under a limit. Accounts) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 470 Tm (Payable checks for split invoices from the same vendor within 30 days.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 442 Tm (3. Separation of duties) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 424 Tm (The person who approves a payment must not be the person who raised the purchase order) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 410 Tm (or the person who added the vendor to the system. The payment run is released by a) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 396 Tm (second member of Accounts Payable.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 368 Tm (4. New vendors) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 350 Tm (A vendor's first payment needs two approvals whatever the amount: the normal approver) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 336 Tm (for that amount, and the Finance Manager. Bank details for a new vendor are confirmed by) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 322 Tm (calling a phone number taken from the contract, not from the invoice.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 294 Tm (5. Changes to bank details) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 276 Tm (A request to change a vendor's bank details is treated as suspicious until confirmed. It) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 262 Tm (is confirmed by phone using the number already on file, and payments to that vendor are) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 248 Tm (held for 5 working days after the change.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 220 Tm (6. Urgent payments) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 202 Tm (A payment outside the weekly payment run needs approval one level above the normal) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 188 Tm (approver.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 160 Tm (7. Month-end) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 142 Tm (No vendor payments are released during the last 2 working days of the month, except) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 128 Tm (payroll-related and tax payments.) Tj
ET
